### 10. Get user profile
GET {{host}}/user/{{userId}}

### 11. Get profile of a nonexistent user
GET {{host}}/user/999999

### 12. Update user profile
PATCH {{host}}/user/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Updated REST User",
  "email": "updated-resttest@example.com",
  "loggedUserID": "{{userId}}"
}

### 13. Update profile with missing fields
PATCH {{host}}/user/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Updated User",
  "loggedUserID": "{{userId}}"
}

### 14. Update another user's profile without permission
PATCH {{host}}/user/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Unauthorized User",
  "email": "unauthorized@example.com",
  "loggedUserID": "999999"
}

### 15. Update profile using an email already in use
PATCH {{host}}/user/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Another Name",
  "email": "existing-user@example.com",
  "loggedUserID": "{{userId}}"
}

