### 25. Get public weather forecasts
GET {{host}}/weather

### 26. Get detailed weather forecast without a user ID
GET {{host}}/weather/{{forecastId}}

### 27. Get detailed weather forecast with a user ID
GET {{host}}/weather/{{forecastId}}?uid={{userId}}

### 28. Admin: Get all weather forecasts
GET {{host}}/admin/weather

